{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0153vQpbxKcxVquUcmVdg32u","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '在 worst 档位下，reviewer 的核心立场是：(1) DPI 已经预测了 rapid saturation，你确认它确实\n2\t  rapid—— 这不构成贡献；(2) θ=0.60 是 arbitrary threshold，K* 完全是 θ 的函数而非数据的固有属性； (3) C3 被有效拒绝（Pythia\n3\t  replication null + arXiv filtering null + effect sizes negligible）； (4) 多个 borderline\n4\t  CI 被视为 systematic underpowering 而非恰好通过；(5) prompt-chain 设计 不具 ecological validity。在此框架下，两个\n5\t  planned 实验的预期结果均会被 reviewer 解读为 confirmatory of their negative assessment——exp-014\n6\t  的弱相关被视为 \"proxy correlating with proxy\"， exp-028 的 power curve 暴露现有实验 borderline\n7\t  结果的统计脆弱性，反而为 reviewer 提供攻击弹药。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: Naturalistic Validation (Common Crawl 2025/2026)\n12\t  plan_id: exp-014\n13\t  description: '对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 随机抽样 ~50K 文档，用训练好的 15D+LightGBM\n14\t    深度分类器 做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和独立 vocabulary richness 指标（type-token ratio, hapax\n15\t    ratio, Yule''s K）做 Spearman correlation。目标是验证实验室 prompt-chain 中发现的 depth signal\n16\t    在 wild data 中是否可观测。\n17\t\n18\t    '\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    predicted_depth_distribution:\n21\t      depth_0: 62-68% of documents\n22\t      depth_1: 22-28% of documents\n23\t      depth_2_plus: 8-12% of documents\n24\t      note: 分布严重右偏——大多数文档被预测为 human 或 gen-1\n25\t    spearman_rho_alignscore_vs_predicted_depth: -0.09\n26\t    spearman_rho_alignscore_p_value: 0.03\n27\t    spearman_rho_ttr_vs_predicted_depth: -0.13\n28\t    spearman_rho_hapax_vs_predicted_depth: -0.11\n29\t    spearman_rho_yules_k_vs_predicted_depth: 0.08\n30\t    false_positive_rate_on_known_human_subset: 0.18\n31\t    classifier_confidence_calibration:\n32\t      mean_max_prob_depth0: 0.52\n33\t      mean_max_prob_depth1: 0.38\n34\t      mean_max_prob_depth2plus: 0.31\n35\t    cross_temporal_drift:\n36\t      cc_2025_vs_cc_2026_depth_distribution_jsd: 0.015\n37\t  result_rationale: '在 worst 档位下，naturalistic validation 的核心问题是 \"没有 ground truth\"。\n38\t\n39\t    (1) 预测分布严重右偏（depth 0-1 占 ~90%）：这符合现实——大多数 web 文本确实是 human-written 或 single-pass\n40\t    AI generated。但 reviewer 会指出：分类器可能只是学到了一个 \"text quality\" proxy， 把低质量 human text\n41\t    错分为 AI-generated（18% false positive rate 支持此解读）。没有 ground truth 就无法区分 \"正确检测到 depth≥1\"\n42\t    与 \"错误分类低质量 human text\"。\n43\t\n44\t    (2) 与 AlignScore 的弱相关（ρ≈-0.09）：AlignScore 测量事实一致性，与 generational depth 之间 没有理论上的强联系。ρ=-0.09\n45\t    在大样本下虽然 statistically significant，但 practically negligible （解释 <1% 方差）。Reviewer\n46\t    会说 \"you''re correlating one noisy proxy with another noisy proxy， neither has\n47\t    validation\"。\n48\t\n49\t    (3) 与 vocabulary richness 的相关稍强（ρ≈-0.13）但仍弱：vocabulary richness 下降与 generational\n50\t    depth 之间有理论预期（DPI 预测 diversity 随迭代下降），但 ρ=-0.13 远不够证明因果关系。更关键的是， vocabulary richness\n51\t    本身被 text length、domain、language register 强烈混淆——没有控制这些变量， 相关不可解释。\n52\t\n53\t    (4) 校准很差（mean max prob ~0.38-0.52）：模型在 wild data 上置信度远低于实验室数据， 说明 distribution\n54\t    shift 严重。Reviewer 会质疑 \"if your classifier is barely above random  confidence on\n55\t    real data, how can the K* characterization from lab data generalize?\"\n56\t\n57\t    (5) 时间漂移极小（JSD=0.015）：本意是展示稳定性，但 reviewer 会反转解读——\"如果 AI contamination 确实在 2025-2026\n58\t    间快速增长，为什么你的 depth distribution 没有变化？要么你的检测器不敏感， 要么你测的不是 depth。\"\n59\t\n60\t    综合效果：worst-tier reviewer 把 exp-014 定性为 \"correlational analysis with no ground\n61\t    truth, effect sizes trivially small, and systematic confounds uncontrolled\"。它不仅不能救\n62\t    C1'' 的 ecological validity 问题，还暴露了 prompt-chain → wild transfer 的 gap。\n63\t\n64\t    '\n65\t  tables:\n66\t  - title: 'Table X: Naturalistic Validation — Correlation with Quality Proxies'\n67\t    columns:\n68\t    - Proxy Metric\n69\t    - Spearman ρ vs Predicted Depth\n70\t    - p-value\n71\t    - 95% CI\n72\t    - Variance Explained\n73\t    rows:\n74\t    - - AlignScore\n75\t      - '-0.09'\n76\t      - '0.03'\n77\t      - '[-0.14, -0.05]'\n78\t      - <1%\n79\t    - - Type-Token Ratio\n80\t      - '-0.13'\n81\t      - '0.002'\n82\t      - '[-0.18, -0.08]'\n83\t      - 1.7%\n84\t    - - Hapax Legomena Ratio\n85\t      - '-0.11'\n86\t      - '0.008'\n87\t      - '[-0.16, -0.06]'\n88\t      - 1.2%\n89\t    - - Yule's K\n90\t      - '+0.08'\n91\t      - '0.04'\n92\t      - '[+0.03, +0.13]'\n93\t      - <1%\n94\t  - title: 'Table Y: Predicted Depth Distribution on Common Crawl'\n95\t    columns:\n96\t    - Predicted Depth\n97\t    - Proportion\n98\t    - Mean Classifier Confidence\n99\t    - 95% CI\n100\t    rows:\n101\t    - - 0 (human)\n102\t      - 65.2%\n103\t      - '0.52'\n104\t      - '[0.50, 0.54]'\n105\t    - - '1'\n106\t      - 24.1%\n107\t      - '0.38'\n108\t      - '[0.36, 0.40]'\n109\t    - - '2'\n110\t      - 7.3%\n111\t      - '0.33'\n112\t      - '[0.30, 0.36]'\n113\t    - - 3+\n114\t      - 3.4%\n115\t      - '0.31'\n116\t      - '[0.28, 0.34]'\n117\t  figures_description:\n118\t  - 'Fig A: Scatter plot of predicted depth vs AlignScore on CC 2025 sample. Massive\n119\t    point cloud with barely visible negative trend. Regression line nearly flat (slope\n120\t    ≈ -0.02). Reviewer 一眼即判 ''no meaningful relationship''。'\n121\t  - 'Fig B: Predicted depth distribution histogram showing extreme right skew (depth\n122\t    0 dominant bar). 与 calibration curve (predicted prob vs observed freq) 对比，显示 severe\n123\t    miscalibration on wild data — predicted depth≥2 严重 overconfident relative to any\n124\t    plausible ground truth。'\n125\t  analysis: 'Worst-tier reviewer response: \"The authors attempt naturalistic validation\n126\t    but this section  raises more questions than it answers. The correlations with\n127\t    quality proxies are negligibly  small (max |ρ|=0.13), and without ground truth\n128\t    depth labels in Common Crawl, these correlations  are uninterpretable. The 18%\n129\t    false positive rate on known-human text is concerning — it suggests  the classifier\n130\t    conflates text quality with generational depth. The severe calibration degradation  (lab\n131\t    confidence ~0.65 → wild confidence ~0.38) indicates substantial distribution shift\n132\t    that  undermines the external validity of the entire K* characterization. This\n133\t    experiment, rather than  validating the lab findings, highlights the gap between\n134\t    controlled prompt-chain settings and  real-world recursive contamination.\"\n135\t\n136\t    Impact on scores: exp-014 结果不会改善任何 worst-tier 分数。Soundness 可能因 calibration 问题\n137\t    进一步受质疑（从 2.75 → 2.5 边界）。Excitement 不变（reviewer 已认定核心 claim trivial）。 唯一微弱正面：论文至少尝试了\n138\t    external validation，避免被 reviewer 批评 \"no attempt at real-world  applicability\"——但结果本身是\n139\t    negative signal。\n140\t\n141\t    '\n142\t- name: Subsampling Power Curve for K*=2 Determination\n143\t  plan_id: exp-028\n144\t  description: '在 C4 domain 上，从已有 n=5000 的 depth chain 数据中做 subsampling： n∈{500, 1000,\n145\t    1500, 2000, 2500, 3000, 3500, 4000, 4500, 5000}，每个 n 做 10 次 无放回抽样，对每个 resample\n146\t    重新跑 5-fold GroupKFold + bootstrap CI，记录 (i) K*=2 的 判定成功率（1v2 CI lower > θ=0.60\n147\t    的比例），(ii) 1v2 AUC point estimate 分布， (iii) CI width 与 n 的关系。用 4 个 continuation-mode\n148\t    模型（Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-cont,  LLaMA-8B）的数据分别计算 power curve，再叠加呈现。\n149\t\n150\t    '\n151\t  expected_results:\n152\t    power_at_n:\n153\t      pythia_1.4b:\n154\t        n_500: 0.1\n155\t        n_1000: 0.2\n156\t        n_1500: 0.4\n157\t        n_2000: 0.5\n158\t        n_2500: 0.6\n159\t        n_3000: 0.7\n160\t        n_3500: 0.8\n161\t        n_4000: 0.9\n162\t        n_4500: 0.9\n163\t        n_5000: 1.0\n164\t        power_80_threshold_n: 3500\n165\t      olmo_1b:\n166\t        n_500: 0.0\n167\t        n_1000: 0.1\n168\t        n_1500: 0.2\n169\t        n_2000: 0.3\n170\t        n_2500: 0.4\n171\t        n_3000: 0.5\n172\t        n_3500: 0.6\n173\t        n_4000: 0.6\n174\t        n_4500: 0.7\n175\t        n_5000: 0.8\n176\t        power_80_threshold_n: '>5000'\n177\t        note: OLMo 1v2 AUC=0.6145——effect size 小，80% power 需要 n>5000\n178\t      qwen_cont:\n179\t        n_500: 0.0\n180\t        n_1000: 0.0\n181\t        n_1500: 0.1\n182\t        n_2000: 0.1\n183\t        n_2500: 0.2\n184\t        n_3000: 0.3\n185\t        n_3500: 0.3\n186\t        n_4000: 0.4\n187\t        n_4500: 0.5\n188\t        n_5000: 0.6\n189\t        power_80_threshold_n: '>5000'\n190\t        note: Qwen-cont 1v2 AUC=0.6112, CI lower=0.6015——effect size 最小，80% power\n191\t          需要 n≈7000-8000\n192\t      llama_8b:\n193\t        n_500: 0.0\n194\t        n_1000: 0.1\n195\t        n_1500: 0.2\n196\t        n_2000: 0.3\n197\t        n_2500: 0.3\n198\t        n_3000: 0.4\n199\t        n_3500: 0.5\n200\t        n_4000: 0.6\n201\t        n_4500: 0.7\n202\t        n_5000: 0.8\n203\t        power_80_threshold_n: '>5000'\n204\t        note: LLaMA 1v2 AUC=0.6123, similar to OLMo\n205\t    ci_width_at_n5000:\n206\t      pythia: 0.018\n207\t      olmo: 0.02\n208\t      qwen_cont: 0.02\n209\t      llama_8b: 0.019\n210\t    ci_width_at_n2000:\n211\t      pythia: 0.031\n212\t      olmo: 0.033\n213\t      qwen_cont: 0.033\n214\t      llama_8b: 0.032\n215\t    mean_1v2_auc_stability:\n216\t      n_1000_sd: 0.015\n217\t      n_2000_sd: 0.01\n218\t      n_3000_sd: 0.008\n219\t      n_5000_sd: 0.005\n220\t    fraction_models_reaching_80pct_power_at_n5000: 1/4\n221\t    fraction_models_reaching_80pct_power_at_n5000_detail: '仅 Pythia (effect size 最大,\n222\t      1v2 AUC=0.654) 在 n=5000 达到 80% power。 OLMo 和 LLaMA 恰好在 n=5000 的 80% 边界。Qwen-cont\n223\t      在 n=5000 仅 ~60% power。\n224\t\n225\t      '\n226\t    implied_n_for_90pct_power_qwen_cont: ~10000\n227\t  result_rationale: '在 worst 档位下，exp-028 的 power analysis 结果会成为 reviewer 手中的武器。核心逻辑链：\n228\t\n229\t    (1) Effect size 极小导致 power 要求极高：C4 continuation mode 下的 1v2 AUC 集中在  0.611-0.654\n230\t    区间（Cohen''s h ≈ 0.20-0.31）。这是 \"small effect\" 区间。在 θ=0.60 下 判定 K*=2 需要 CI lower\n231\t    > 0.60，即需要排除 AUC=0.60。当真实 AUC 仅 0.611（Qwen-cont）， 真实值与阈值之差仅 0.011——这要求极窄的 CI，进而需要极大的\n232\t    n。\n233\t\n234\t    (2) n=5000 仅对 Pythia 充分：Pythia 的 1v2 AUC=0.654（距 θ 0.054 pp margin）在 n=5000  下\n235\t    power≈100%。但 OLMo（AUC=0.6145, margin=0.0145）和 LLaMA（AUC=0.6123, margin=0.0123）\n236\t    在 n=5000 下 power 仅 ~80%（恰好边界），Qwen-cont（AUC=0.6112, margin=0.0112）power 仅  ~60%。Reviewer\n237\t    会指出：\"你论文中 4 个 continuation-mode 模型，有 3 个在 n=5000 的 power  不足 80%——你 claim 的 ''7/8\n238\t    configurations K*=2'' 有多少是 lucky resamples？\"\n239\t\n240\t    (3) Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 被确认为统计侥幸：power analysis 显示 Qwen-cont 在 n=5000  下仅\n241\t    60% 的 resamples 能给出 CI lower > 0.60。这意味着 Qwen-cont K*=2 的判定有 40%  概率在另一次采样中翻转为\n242\t    K*=1。这直接确认了 reviewer 的 \"systematic insufficient power\"  批评——Qwen-cont 的 K*=2 不是\n243\t    robust finding，而是 stochastic outcome。\n244\t\n245\t    (4) θ-dependency 批评被强化：如果 θ 从 0.60 移至 0.62（仅 +0.02），则 Qwen-cont 和 LLaMA  立即变为\n246\t    K*=1，OLMo 的 power 也大幅下降。Power curve 本质上是 θ-sensitivity analysis 的 另一种呈现——它展示了\n247\t    K* 判定对 (θ, n) 二维参数空间的敏感性。Reviewer 会说 \"K* is not a  property of the data but a\n248\t    joint function of your arbitrary threshold and your sample size\"。\n249\t\n250\t    (5) 对 arXiv K*=3 的间接负面影响：arXiv 实验每模型仅 n=2200。如果 C4 在 n=5000 下都 power 不足，arXiv\n251\t    在 n=2200 下的 2v3 boundary pair（AUC≈0.62-0.65）power 估计仅 50-70%。 虽然 arXiv 的 effect\n252\t    size 稍大（2v3 AUC 0.62-0.65 vs C4 1v2 AUC 0.61-0.65），但 n  减半的效应更大。Reviewer 不需要看\n253\t    arXiv power curve 就能推断 \"your arXiv K*=3 claims  are equally fragile\"。\n254\t\n255\t    (6) 唯一 partial mitigation：Pythia 在 n≥3500 已达 80% power，且 Pythia 的 K*=2 判定 robust。这保住了\n256\t    \"至少有一个模型 robustly K*=2\" 的最低线。但从 \"7/8 configurations K*=2\"  退化为 \"1/4 robustly,\n257\t    3/4 borderline\" 是 devastating for the universality narrative。\n258\t\n259\t    综合效果：exp-028 是一把双刃剑。在 best/mid tier 下它展示方法论严谨性；但在 worst tier 下， reviewer 会用它来论证\n260\t    \"the authors'' own power analysis demonstrates that their headline  claim of K*=2\n261\t    universality is an artifact of barely-sufficient sample sizes and an  arbitrary\n262\t    threshold\"。这直接击中 worst tier 的两个核心假设：θ-contingent artifact 和 systematic insufficient\n263\t    power。\n264\t\n265\t    '\n266\t  tables:\n267\t  - title: 'Table X: Power to Detect K*=2 (1v2 CI lower > θ=0.60) by Sample Size'\n268\t    columns:\n269\t    - Model\n270\t    - True 1v2 AUC\n271\t    - Margin over θ\n272\t    - n for 80% Power\n273\t    - Power @ n=5000\n274\t    - Power @ n=2000\n275\t    rows:\n276\t    - - Pythia-1.4B\n277\t      - '0.654'\n278\t      - '+0.054'\n279\t      - ~3500\n280\t      - '1.00'\n281\t      - '0.50'\n282\t    - - OLMo-1B\n283\t      - '0.615'\n284\t      - '+0.015'\n285\t      - '>5000'\n286\t      - '0.80'\n287\t      - '0.30'\n288\t    - - LLaMA-3.1-8B\n289\t      - '0.612'\n290\t      - '+0.012'\n291\t      - '>5000'\n292\t      - '0.80'\n293\t      - '0.30'\n294\t    - - Qwen-1.5B cont\n295\t      - '0.611'\n296\t      - '+0.011'\n297\t      - ~7000-8000\n298\t      - '0.60'\n299\t      - '0.10'\n300\t    - - Qwen-7B\n301\t      - '0.618'\n302\t      - '+0.018'\n303\t      - ~4500\n304\t      - '0.90'\n305\t      - '0.30'\n306\t  - title: 'Table Y: CI Width Scaling with Sample Size (averaged across 4 models)'\n307\t    columns:\n308\t    - n\n309\t    - Mean CI Width\n310\t    - Mean Power\n311\t    - Fraction Models K*=2 Robust\n312\t    rows:\n313\t    - - '500'\n314\t      - '0.055'\n315\t      - '0.03'\n316\t      - 0/4\n317\t    - - '1000'\n318\t      - '0.038'\n319\t      - '0.10'\n320\t      - 0/4\n321\t    - - '2000'\n322\t      - '0.032'\n323\t      - '0.30'\n324\t      - 0/4\n325\t    - - '3000'\n326\t      - '0.025'\n327\t      - '0.48'\n328\t      - 0/4\n329\t    - - '3500'\n330\t      - '0.023'\n331\t      - '0.55'\n332\t      - 1/4\n333\t    - - '4000'\n334\t      - '0.020'\n335\t      - '0.65'\n336\t      - 1/4\n337\t    - - '5000'\n338\t      - '0.019'\n339\t      - '0.80'\n340\t      - 1/4 (Pythia only robust)\n341\t  figures_description:\n342\t  - 'Fig A: Power curve — x-axis: sample size n (500-5000), y-axis: proportion of\n343\t    resamples with 1v2 CI lower > 0.60. Four colored lines (one per model). Pythia\n344\t    rises steeply and reaches 1.0 at n=5000. OLMo and LLaMA rise slowly, reaching\n345\t    ~0.80 at n=5000. Qwen-cont is the flattest curve, reaching only ~0.60 at n=5000.\n346\t    Horizontal dashed line at power=0.80. Key visual takeaway: only 1/4 models crosses\n347\t    the 80% power line at n=5000. Reviewer reads this as ''systematic underpower''.'\n348\t  - 'Fig B: Spaghetti plot of 1v2 AUC point estimates across 10 resamples at each\n349\t    n for Qwen-cont. Shows high variance at small n (SD≈0.015 at n=1000) with several\n350\t    resamples dipping below 0.60. Even at n=5000, 4/10 resamples give CI lower < 0.60.\n351\t    Visually communicates instability of the K*=2 determination for borderline models.'\n352\t  analysis: 'Worst-tier reviewer response: \"The power analysis in exp-028, while methodologically  commendable,\n353\t    actually undermines the paper''s central claims. The authors show that only  1\n354\t    of 4 continuation-mode models (Pythia-1.4B) achieves 80% power for K*=2 detection  at\n355\t    their sample size of n=5000. The remaining 3 models — including Qwen-cont (CI\n356\t    lower  = 0.6015, power ≈ 60%), OLMo (power ≈ 80% borderline), and LLaMA (power\n357\t    ≈ 80% borderline)  — are systematically underpowered. The Qwen-cont result is\n358\t    particularly damning: the  authors'' own analysis shows a 40% chance that an independent\n359\t    replication would yield K*=1  instead of K*=2. This transforms the ''7/8 configurations\n360\t    yield K*=2'' headline into  ''the majority of configurations are at or below the\n361\t    minimum power threshold for reliable  detection.'' Combined with the θ-sensitivity\n362\t    concern (moving θ by +0.02 would flip 3 of  4 models to K*=1), this analysis suggests\n363\t    K*=2 is not a robust empirical finding but  rather a contingent outcome of the\n364\t    specific (θ, n) parameterization chosen by the authors.\"\n365\t\n366\t    Impact on scores: exp-028 在 worst tier 下是净负面。它被 reviewer 用作 \"authors provided  the\n367\t    rope to hang their own claims\" 的典型案例。Soundness 分数受打击（从 2.75 → 2.5 区间 下端），因为 reviewer\n368\t    现在有了 quantitative evidence for underpower。Excitement 不变 （已经很低）。唯一好处：Clarity 分数可能因为\n369\t    \"transparent reporting\" 微升（3.0 → 3.25）， 但不影响 meta recommendation。'\n370\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e067f0b3-3faa-431a-a54f-b8ace4db1c62","uuid":"e6cdb60f-9081-4d12-af4e-94d177d76a0e","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:14:41.012Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T113009/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '在 worst 档位下，reviewer 的核心立场是：(1) DPI 已经预测了 rapid saturation，你确认它确实\n  rapid—— 这不构成贡献；(2) θ=0.60 是 arbitrary threshold，K* 完全是 θ 的函数而非数据的固有属性； (3) C3 被有效拒绝（Pythia\n  replication null + arXiv filtering null + effect sizes negligible）； (4) 多个 borderline\n  CI 被视为 systematic underpowering 而非恰好通过；(5) prompt-chain 设计 不具 ecological validity。在此框架下，两个\n  planned 实验的预期结果均会被 reviewer 解读为 confirmatory of their negative assessment——exp-014\n  的弱相关被视为 \"proxy correlating with proxy\"， exp-028 的 power curve 暴露现有实验 borderline\n  结果的统计脆弱性，反而为 reviewer 提供攻击弹药。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Naturalistic Validation (Common Crawl 2025/2026)\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: '对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 随机抽样 ~50K 文档，用训练好的 15D+LightGBM\n    深度分类器 做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和独立 vocabulary richness 指标（type-token ratio, hapax\n    ratio, Yule''s K）做 Spearman correlation。目标是验证实验室 prompt-chain 中发现的 depth signal\n    在 wild data 中是否可观测。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    predicted_depth_distribution:\n      depth_0: 62-68% of documents\n      depth_1: 22-28% of documents\n      depth_2_plus: 8-12% of documents\n      note: 分布严重右偏——大多数文档被预测为 human 或 gen-1\n    spearman_rho_alignscore_vs_predicted_depth: -0.09\n    spearman_rho_alignscore_p_value: 0.03\n    spearman_rho_ttr_vs_predicted_depth: -0.13\n    spearman_rho_hapax_vs_predicted_depth: -0.11\n    spearman_rho_yules_k_vs_predicted_depth: 0.08\n    false_positive_rate_on_known_human_subset: 0.18\n    classifier_confidence_calibration:\n      mean_max_prob_depth0: 0.52\n      mean_max_prob_depth1: 0.38\n      mean_max_prob_depth2plus: 0.31\n    cross_temporal_drift:\n      cc_2025_vs_cc_2026_depth_distribution_jsd: 0.015\n  result_rationale: '在 worst 档位下，naturalistic validation 的核心问题是 \"没有 ground truth\"。\n\n    (1) 预测分布严重右偏（depth 0-1 占 ~90%）：这符合现实——大多数 web 文本确实是 human-written 或 single-pass\n    AI generated。但 reviewer 会指出：分类器可能只是学到了一个 \"text quality\" proxy， 把低质量 human text\n    错分为 AI-generated（18% false positive rate 支持此解读）。没有 ground truth 就无法区分 \"正确检测到 depth≥1\"\n    与 \"错误分类低质量 human text\"。\n\n    (2) 与 AlignScore 的弱相关（ρ≈-0.09）：AlignScore 测量事实一致性，与 generational depth 之间 没有理论上的强联系。ρ=-0.09\n    在大样本下虽然 statistically significant，但 practically negligible （解释 <1% 方差）。Reviewer\n    会说 \"you''re correlating one noisy proxy with another noisy proxy， neither has\n    validation\"。\n\n    (3) 与 vocabulary richness 的相关稍强（ρ≈-0.13）但仍弱：vocabulary richness 下降与 generational\n    depth 之间有理论预期（DPI 预测 diversity 随迭代下降），但 ρ=-0.13 远不够证明因果关系。更关键的是， vocabulary richness\n    本身被 text length、domain、language register 强烈混淆——没有控制这些变量， 相关不可解释。\n\n    (4) 校准很差（mean max prob ~0.38-0.52）：模型在 wild data 上置信度远低于实验室数据， 说明 distribution\n    shift 严重。Reviewer 会质疑 \"if your classifier is barely above random  confidence on\n    real data, how can the K* characterization from lab data generalize?\"\n\n    (5) 时间漂移极小（JSD=0.015）：本意是展示稳定性，但 reviewer 会反转解读——\"如果 AI contamination 确实在 2025-2026\n    间快速增长，为什么你的 depth distribution 没有变化？要么你的检测器不敏感， 要么你测的不是 depth。\"\n\n    综合效果：worst-tier reviewer 把 exp-014 定性为 \"correlational analysis with no ground\n    truth, effect sizes trivially small, and systematic confounds uncontrolled\"。它不仅不能救\n    C1'' 的 ecological validity 问题，还暴露了 prompt-chain → wild transfer 的 gap。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table X: Naturalistic Validation — Correlation with Quality Proxies'\n    columns:\n    - Proxy Metric\n    - Spearman ρ vs Predicted Depth\n    - p-value\n    - 95% CI\n    - Variance Explained\n    rows:\n    - - AlignScore\n      - '-0.09'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '[-0.14, -0.05]'\n      - <1%\n    - - Type-Token Ratio\n      - '-0.13'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '[-0.18, -0.08]'\n      - 1.7%\n    - - Hapax Legomena Ratio\n      - '-0.11'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '[-0.16, -0.06]'\n      - 1.2%\n    - - Yule's K\n      - '+0.08'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '[+0.03, +0.13]'\n      - <1%\n  - title: 'Table Y: Predicted Depth Distribution on Common Crawl'\n    columns:\n    - Predicted Depth\n    - Proportion\n    - Mean Classifier Confidence\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - 0 (human)\n      - 65.2%\n      - '0.52'\n      - '[0.50, 0.54]'\n    - - '1'\n      - 24.1%\n      - '0.38'\n      - '[0.36, 0.40]'\n    - - '2'\n      - 7.3%\n      - '0.33'\n      - '[0.30, 0.36]'\n    - - 3+\n      - 3.4%\n      - '0.31'\n      - '[0.28, 0.34]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig A: Scatter plot of predicted depth vs AlignScore on CC 2025 sample. Massive\n    point cloud with barely visible negative trend. Regression line nearly flat (slope\n    ≈ -0.02). Reviewer 一眼即判 ''no meaningful relationship''。'\n  - 'Fig B: Predicted depth distribution histogram showing extreme right skew (depth\n    0 dominant bar). 与 calibration curve (predicted prob vs observed freq) 对比，显示 severe\n    miscalibration on wild data — predicted depth≥2 严重 overconfident relative to any\n    plausible ground truth。'\n  analysis: 'Worst-tier reviewer response: \"The authors attempt naturalistic validation\n    but this section  raises more questions than it answers. The correlations with\n    quality proxies are negligibly  small (max |ρ|=0.13), and without ground truth\n    depth labels in Common Crawl, these correlations  are uninterpretable. The 18%\n    false positive rate on known-human text is concerning — it suggests  the classifier\n    conflates text quality with generational depth. The severe calibration degradation  (lab\n    confidence ~0.65 → wild confidence ~0.38) indicates substantial distribution shift\n    that  undermines the external validity of the entire K* characterization. This\n    experiment, rather than  validating the lab findings, highlights the gap between\n    controlled prompt-chain settings and  real-world recursive contamination.\"\n\n    Impact on scores: exp-014 结果不会改善任何 worst-tier 分数。Soundness 可能因 calibration 问题\n    进一步受质疑（从 2.75 → 2.5 边界）。Excitement 不变（reviewer 已认定核心 claim trivial）。 唯一微弱正面：论文至少尝试了\n    external validation，避免被 reviewer 批评 \"no attempt at real-world  applicability\"——但结果本身是\n    negative signal。\n\n    '\n- name: Subsampling Power Curve for K*=2 Determination\n  plan_id: exp-028\n  description: '在 C4 domain 上，从已有 n=5000 的 depth chain 数据中做 subsampling： n∈{500, 1000,\n    1500, 2000, 2500, 3000, 3500, 4000, 4500, 5000}，每个 n 做 10 次 无放回抽样，对每个 resample\n    重新跑 5-fold GroupKFold + bootstrap CI，记录 (i) K*=2 的 判定成功率（1v2 CI lower > θ=0.60\n    的比例），(ii) 1v2 AUC point estimate 分布， (iii) CI width 与 n 的关系。用 4 个 continuation-mode\n    模型（Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-cont,  LLaMA-8B）的数据分别计算 power curve，再叠加呈现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    power_at_n:\n      pythia_1.4b:\n        n_500: 0.1\n        n_1000: 0.2\n        n_1500: 0.4\n        n_2000: 0.5\n        n_2500: 0.6\n        n_3000: 0.7\n        n_3500: 0.8\n        n_4000: 0.9\n        n_4500: 0.9\n        n_5000: 1.0\n        power_80_threshold_n: 3500\n      olmo_1b:\n        n_500: 0.0\n        n_1000: 0.1\n        n_1500: 0.2\n        n_2000: 0.3\n        n_2500: 0.4\n        n_3000: 0.5\n        n_3500: 0.6\n        n_4000: 0.6\n        n_4500: 0.7\n        n_5000: 0.8\n        power_80_threshold_n: '>5000'\n        note: OLMo 1v2 AUC=0.6145——effect size 小，80% power 需要 n>5000\n      qwen_cont:\n        n_500: 0.0\n        n_1000: 0.0\n        n_1500: 0.1\n        n_2000: 0.1\n        n_2500: 0.2\n        n_3000: 0.3\n        n_3500: 0.3\n        n_4000: 0.4\n        n_4500: 0.5\n        n_5000: 0.6\n        power_80_threshold_n: '>5000'\n        note: Qwen-cont 1v2 AUC=0.6112, CI lower=0.6015——effect size 最小，80% power\n          需要 n≈7000-8000\n      llama_8b:\n        n_500: 0.0\n        n_1000: 0.1\n        n_1500: 0.2\n        n_2000: 0.3\n        n_2500: 0.3\n        n_3000: 0.4\n        n_3500: 0.5\n        n_4000: 0.6\n        n_4500: 0.7\n        n_5000: 0.8\n        power_80_threshold_n: '>5000'\n        note: LLaMA 1v2 AUC=0.6123, similar to OLMo\n    ci_width_at_n5000:\n      pythia: 0.018\n      olmo: 0.02\n      qwen_cont: 0.02\n      llama_8b: 0.019\n    ci_width_at_n2000:\n      pythia: 0.031\n      olmo: 0.033\n      qwen_cont: 0.033\n      llama_8b: 0.032\n    mean_1v2_auc_stability:\n      n_1000_sd: 0.015\n      n_2000_sd: 0.01\n      n_3000_sd: 0.008\n      n_5000_sd: 0.005\n    fraction_models_reaching_80pct_power_at_n5000: 1/4\n    fraction_models_reaching_80pct_power_at_n5000_detail: '仅 Pythia (effect size 最大,\n      1v2 AUC=0.654) 在 n=5000 达到 80% power。 OLMo 和 LLaMA 恰好在 n=5000 的 80% 边界。Qwen-cont\n      在 n=5000 仅 ~60% power。\n\n      '\n    implied_n_for_90pct_power_qwen_cont: ~10000\n  result_rationale: '在 worst 档位下，exp-028 的 power analysis 结果会成为 reviewer 手中的武器。核心逻辑链：\n\n    (1) Effect size 极小导致 power 要求极高：C4 continuation mode 下的 1v2 AUC 集中在  0.611-0.654\n    区间（Cohen''s h ≈ 0.20-0.31）。这是 \"small effect\" 区间。在 θ=0.60 下 判定 K*=2 需要 CI lower\n    > 0.60，即需要排除 AUC=0.60。当真实 AUC 仅 0.611（Qwen-cont）， 真实值与阈值之差仅 0.011——这要求极窄的 CI，进而需要极大的\n    n。\n\n    (2) n=5000 仅对 Pythia 充分：Pythia 的 1v2 AUC=0.654（距 θ 0.054 pp margin）在 n=5000  下\n    power≈100%。但 OLMo（AUC=0.6145, margin=0.0145）和 LLaMA（AUC=0.6123, margin=0.0123）\n    在 n=5000 下 power 仅 ~80%（恰好边界），Qwen-cont（AUC=0.6112, margin=0.0112）power 仅  ~60%。Reviewer\n    会指出：\"你论文中 4 个 continuation-mode 模型，有 3 个在 n=5000 的 power  不足 80%——你 claim 的 ''7/8\n    configurations K*=2'' 有多少是 lucky resamples？\"\n\n    (3) Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 被确认为统计侥幸：power analysis 显示 Qwen-cont 在 n=5000  下仅\n    60% 的 resamples 能给出 CI lower > 0.60。这意味着 Qwen-cont K*=2 的判定有 40%  概率在另一次采样中翻转为\n    K*=1。这直接确认了 reviewer 的 \"systematic insufficient power\"  批评——Qwen-cont 的 K*=2 不是\n    robust finding，而是 stochastic outcome。\n\n    (4) θ-dependency 批评被强化：如果 θ 从 0.60 移至 0.62（仅 +0.02），则 Qwen-cont 和 LLaMA  立即变为\n    K*=1，OLMo 的 power 也大幅下降。Power curve 本质上是 θ-sensitivity analysis 的 另一种呈现——它展示了\n    K* 判定对 (θ, n) 二维参数空间的敏感性。Reviewer 会说 \"K* is not a  property of the data but a\n    joint function of your arbitrary threshold and your sample size\"。\n\n    (5) 对 arXiv K*=3 的间接负面影响：arXiv 实验每模型仅 n=2200。如果 C4 在 n=5000 下都 power 不足，arXiv\n    在 n=2200 下的 2v3 boundary pair（AUC≈0.62-0.65）power 估计仅 50-70%。 虽然 arXiv 的 effect\n    size 稍大（2v3 AUC 0.62-0.65 vs C4 1v2 AUC 0.61-0.65），但 n  减半的效应更大。Reviewer 不需要看\n    arXiv power curve 就能推断 \"your arXiv K*=3 claims  are equally fragile\"。\n\n    (6) 唯一 partial mitigation：Pythia 在 n≥3500 已达 80% power，且 Pythia 的 K*=2 判定 robust。这保住了\n    \"至少有一个模型 robustly K*=2\" 的最低线。但从 \"7/8 configurations K*=2\"  退化为 \"1/4 robustly,\n    3/4 borderline\" 是 devastating for the universality narrative。\n\n    综合效果：exp-028 是一把双刃剑。在 best/mid tier 下它展示方法论严谨性；但在 worst tier 下， reviewer 会用它来论证\n    \"the authors'' own power analysis demonstrates that their headline  claim of K*=2\n    universality is an artifact of barely-sufficient sample sizes and an  arbitrary\n    threshold\"。这直接击中 worst tier 的两个核心假设：θ-contingent artifact 和 systematic insufficient\n    power。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table X: Power to Detect K*=2 (1v2 CI lower > θ=0.60) by Sample Size'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - True 1v2 AUC\n    - Margin over θ\n    - n for 80% Power\n    - Power @ n=5000\n    - Power @ n=2000\n    rows:\n    - - Pythia-1.4B\n      - '0.654'\n      - '+0.054'\n      - ~3500\n      - '1.00'\n      - '0.50'\n    - - OLMo-1B\n      - '0.615'\n      - '+0.015'\n      - '>5000'\n      - '0.80'\n      - '0.30'\n    - - LLaMA-3.1-8B\n      - '0.612'\n      - '+0.012'\n      - '>5000'\n      - '0.80'\n      - '0.30'\n    - - Qwen-1.5B cont\n      - '0.611'\n      - '+0.011'\n      - ~7000-8000\n      - '0.60'\n      - '0.10'\n    - - Qwen-7B\n      - '0.618'\n      - '+0.018'\n      - ~4500\n      - '0.90'\n      - '0.30'\n  - title: 'Table Y: CI Width Scaling with Sample Size (averaged across 4 models)'\n    columns:\n    - n\n    - Mean CI Width\n    - Mean Power\n    - Fraction Models K*=2 Robust\n    rows:\n    - - '500'\n      - '0.055'\n      - '0.03'\n      - 0/4\n    - - '1000'\n      - '0.038'\n      - '0.10'\n      - 0/4\n    - - '2000'\n      - '0.032'\n      - '0.30'\n      - 0/4\n    - - '3000'\n      - '0.025'\n      - '0.48'\n      - 0/4\n    - - '3500'\n      - '0.023'\n      - '0.55'\n      - 1/4\n    - - '4000'\n      - '0.020'\n      - '0.65'\n      - 1/4\n    - - '5000'\n      - '0.019'\n      - '0.80'\n      - 1/4 (Pythia only robust)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig A: Power curve — x-axis: sample size n (500-5000), y-axis: proportion of\n    resamples with 1v2 CI lower > 0.60. Four colored lines (one per model). Pythia\n    rises steeply and reaches 1.0 at n=5000. OLMo and LLaMA rise slowly, reaching\n    ~0.80 at n=5000. Qwen-cont is the flattest curve, reaching only ~0.60 at n=5000.\n    Horizontal dashed line at power=0.80. Key visual takeaway: only 1/4 models crosses\n    the 80% power line at n=5000. Reviewer reads this as ''systematic underpower''.'\n  - 'Fig B: Spaghetti plot of 1v2 AUC point estimates across 10 resamples at each\n    n for Qwen-cont. Shows high variance at small n (SD≈0.015 at n=1000) with several\n    resamples dipping below 0.60. Even at n=5000, 4/10 resamples give CI lower < 0.60.\n    Visually communicates instability of the K*=2 determination for borderline models.'\n  analysis: 'Worst-tier reviewer response: \"The power analysis in exp-028, while methodologically  commendable,\n    actually undermines the paper''s central claims. The authors show that only  1\n    of 4 continuation-mode models (Pythia-1.4B) achieves 80% power for K*=2 detection  at\n    their sample size of n=5000. The remaining 3 models — including Qwen-cont (CI\n    lower  = 0.6015, power ≈ 60%), OLMo (power ≈ 80% borderline), and LLaMA (power\n    ≈ 80% borderline)  — are systematically underpowered. The Qwen-cont result is\n    particularly damning: the  authors'' own analysis shows a 40% chance that an independent\n    replication would yield K*=1  instead of K*=2. This transforms the ''7/8 configurations\n    yield K*=2'' headline into  ''the majority of configurations are at or below the\n    minimum power threshold for reliable  detection.'' Combined with the θ-sensitivity\n    concern (moving θ by +0.02 would flip 3 of  4 models to K*=1), this analysis suggests\n    K*=2 is not a robust empirical finding but  rather a contingent outcome of the\n    specific (θ, n) parameterization chosen by the authors.\"\n\n    Impact on scores: exp-028 在 worst tier 下是净负面。它被 reviewer 用作 \"authors provided  the\n    rope to hang their own claims\" 的典型案例。Soundness 分数受打击（从 2.75 → 2.5 区间 下端），因为 reviewer\n    现在有了 quantitative evidence for underpower。Excitement 不变 （已经很低）。唯一好处：Clarity 分数可能因为\n    \"transparent reporting\" 微升（3.0 → 3.25）， 但不影响 meta recommendation。'\n","numLines":370,"startLine":1,"totalLines":370}}}
